1
00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:01,973
(Amy:)by sowing discord
in our relationship.

2
00:00:02,135 --> 00:00:04,375
(Amy:)He's manipulating you
like he always does.

3
00:00:05,739 --> 00:00:07,409
(Sheldon:)Wait, now, hang on.

4
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:09,981
(Sheldon:)You think he manipulates me?

5
00:00:10,143 --> 00:00:11,183
(Amy:)All the time.

6
00:00:12,212 --> 00:00:15,352
(Amy:)And he knew that as your girlfriend,
I wasn't gonna stand by

7
00:00:15,515 --> 00:00:17,855
(Amy:)and let him bring a table
into your apartment.

8
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:20,088
I mean, a table? Come on!

9
00:00:22,556 --> 00:00:24,096
(Sheldon:)It is hideous.

10
00:00:25,225 --> 00:00:26,565
(Amy:)Well, thankfully,
I won't have to see it,

11
00:00:26,726 --> 00:00:28,206
(Amy:)'cause I won't be your
girlfriend anymore.

12
00:00:29,829 --> 00:00:31,569
(Amy:)Amy Farrah Fowler.

13
00:00:32,399 --> 00:00:34,279
(Amy:)Why, yes, I would like
to take a survey.

14
00:00:34,434 --> 00:00:35,934
(Leonard:)Wait.

15
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:40,250
(Sheldon:)You were really gonna stand by me
against the dining room table?

16
00:00:41,608 --> 00:00:43,088
(Amy:)Of course I was.

17
00:00:43,944 --> 00:00:45,444
(Leonard:)Wait.

18
00:00:45,612 --> 00:00:49,062
(Sheldon:)How do I know that you're
not manipulating me right now?

19
00:00:50,584 --> 00:00:53,464
(Amy:)I think if I were manipulating you,
you'd be smart enough to see it.

20
00:00:55,622 --> 00:01:00,022
(Sheldon:)How do I know you're not saying that
as part of the manipulation?

